# Vigile — Docker Build Context Exclusions
# Minimize build context for faster builds and smaller images

## Version Control
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

## Python — Runtime Artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/
*.whl
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

## Virtual Environments (not needed in image)
.venv/
venv/
env/

## Environment Files (security!)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

## Testing & Development (not needed in image)
tests/
scripts/
docs/
.pytest_tmp/
.coverage*
htmlcov/

## Database & Data
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite*

## Logs
*.log
*.log.*

## Documentation (keep in repo, not in image)
*.md
RULES.md
AGENTS.md
codemap.md

## Configuration Files (not needed)
opencode.json
.dockerignore
.editorconfig

## IDE & Tool Artifacts
.vscode/
.cursor/
.idea/
.slim/
.sisyphus/
.playwright-mcp/
.browserstack-local/
.mypy_incremental/

## OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Misc
.env.example
/tmp/
*.swp
*.swo
